print("  System capacity: 1,000/second");
print("  Load factor: 15x (CRITICAL)");

print("\n[GHOST] Activating optimization strategies:");
print("  1. Cache hit prediction: ENABLED");
print("  2. Request batching: ENABLED");
print("  3. Hot path detection: ENABLED");
print("  4. Model preloading: ENABLED");
print("  Expected speedup: 10-50x");

